WEBVTT

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:11.070
I got a love-call from my teacher saying, "Kamijou-chan, you're getting supplementary lessons because you're stupid~"

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:14.880
What misfortune…

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.300
Well, the weather is nice, so I guess it wouldn't hurt...

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.330
to put up my futon and change the atmosphere.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.200
The sky is so blue,

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.600
Yet my future seems so dark.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.220
It just better not start raining…

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:48.600
I-Isn't this that squid thing that...

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.440
invaded the OP on Nico-something…?

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.610
I'm…

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.470
Eh?

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:01.780
I'm hungry…

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:03.010
Hello?

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.750
If you let me fill up my stomach, I'd be really happy ~de geso.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:14.050
Geso…?

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.830
Don't tell me we've been invaded.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:23.100
Squids build their bodies with a low fat diet with core proteins ~de-

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:30.570
Geso!!

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:36.120
Was the "To Aru" series just saved from being invaded…?

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.250
Where am I supposed to look?!

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.620
Hey!

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:47.700
Where are you going Sphinx?! Wait up!

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:54.100
A hotel? Don't tell me Index is...

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:56.460
Index!!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.370
Yay! It's a festival!

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:13.510
The Obon festival is a traditional Japanese festival.

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:17.740
But because the youngsters these days can't fit in with the tradition,

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.740
It's not exactly popular.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:23.330
But imagine if everyone just started practicing their dancing!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.590
But then they'll say "It's so stupid, why should I?"

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.320
And then the girls start crying...

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:33.870
Then guys come out to comfort them, and then after the festival ends…

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:37.700
They start going out…

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.550
Ah, it's Touma! It's Touma! It's Touma!

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:11.240
I'll beat those rotten guts of yours…

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.960
<b>Right now!</b>

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.250
No…

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.200
Stop, don't come near me...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.930
And then...

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.140
This light must be…

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.370
Onee-sama!

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.700
You mustn't come near!

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:52.870
Kuroko!!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:52.900
And then...
Kuroko!!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.840
And then...

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:09.340
Why don't you just go back to your goddamn hole, you stupid bitch!!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.980
And then...

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.000
Are you wearing your panties~?

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:34.390
Littering?!

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.160
There are cigarette butts all over France!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:43.270
Go… Hyper-Innocentius!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:49.400
Don't use that in a confined place like this!!

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.070
Everything's going to burn.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:13.950
Index was the only one who was supposed to turn mini in this anime…

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:16.000
Why do I have to...

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.000
That's right Touma, that's right.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:25.220
My worth might go down a bit ~de geso.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:29.430
Sheesh… Really, this anime…

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:32.900
Ow,

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.350
Hey that just hurt me down there, be careful!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.480
Touma experienced pain in the nether regions while walking ~de geso

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.580
From my memory of medical science...

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.490
I believe it may be a terrible illness.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:49.260
But something a bit more indecent might be the cause…

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:50.830
Geso?!

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.220
Hey Agnese, could you follow up or something instead of staying quiet?

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:59.300
What are you talking about? I've already talked plenty.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:00.620
Sheesh.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.970
Touma…

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:07.050
You got distracted by <i>that</i>?!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.400
Ahh, get bald! Get bald!

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.050
Get bald! Get bald!

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:13.060
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.230
Get bald! Get bald!

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:17.240
Because of you, now I've been misunderstood!

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:36.000
As of late, Onee-sama's been interested in the opposite gender…

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:40.960
Hey, Uiharu… are you listening?

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.670
Of course I am.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.670
Then it's fine.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:54.680
I feel that the flowers on your head have become a bit too cute lately...

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.100
I've noticed it recently, myself,

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.060
It's becoming like a flower arrangement isn't it?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:03.470
A staff member I met online was randomly talking...

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:05.470
"I always forget to draw a few, it's tough…"

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:10.880
To be honest, I think staff members who start...

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:14.690
leaking inside information without realizing it are pretty stupid

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:23.400
Well, I see them as people who need to use that information...

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:27.740
for others to even acknowledge their existance.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:31.490
Well getting back on topic...

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:35.980
Flowers <i>are</i> pretty hard to draw, aren't they?

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:41.750
I don't think you have a right to say that with all the flowers on your head...

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:47.610
By the way, what do you do in the winter?

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.000
These are artificial flowers!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:19.800
Nanasenen!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:22.930
Nanasenen...

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.120
Nanasenen...

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:26.120
Nanase- Nanasenen...

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:27.510
<b><i>Nana Sen Ennnnn...</i></b>

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:27.840
<b><i>Nana Sen Ennnnn...</i></b>

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.190
<b><i>Nana Sen Ennnnn...</i></b>

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.030
I'm sorry for always causing you trouble.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:58.630
Even if I was drunk, to attack an ally is just...

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.130
But, I don't actually remember it...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.450
That is, until Tsuchimikado told me.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.030
I will atone for this somehow.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.430
Um...

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:11.520
I'll atone for it with my body.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.660
Yamasaki

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:32.070
Of course, the game being played here is a game with a bunch of cute girls.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.050
<b>I was originally thinking of making a pun on
"Ore no Misaka-Imouto ga Konna ni Kawaii
wake ga nai" but I couldn't think of anything.</b>

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:38.050
Ignored in bliss

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.520
You know, I hate people who try to say that they have misfortune...

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:43.640
or are extremely unlucky as an excuse.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:48.040
Regardless of how many times you win, seeing you guys all beaten up...

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:49.520
Sensei's...

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.020
Sensei is...
